7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m picking the invoices for outside hire and the round trip for a hot lunch. I need to see where our time and money actually go before we commit.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m taking the quotes for the two fit-outs and the partition wall. I need the hard numbers and the acoustic reality before we sign anything.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I will look into the crumbs and bins at the desks, and the facilities callouts on this floor.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I’m curious why Jonathan is focusing on the awkward conversation. Is that relevant to the room’s function, or just personal history?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It’s relevant. If we can’t speak freely here, the room fails its purpose. I’m checking if the layout prevents that.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, it’s not just history. If the room forces awkwardness, it’s a failure. I’m checking the time cost of the current chaos.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, it’s relevant. If the room can’t hold a difficult conversation, it’s useless. I’m checking the physical barriers that make that impossible.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, it is relevant. A room that breeds silence is a room that fails. I am checking the physical evidence of how we actually use this space.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I appreciate the consensus. I am simply verifying if the current usage patterns justify a dedicated function, or if we are just perpetuating the status quo.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We need to know if the current chaos is a symptom of the room’s design or just our habits.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, exactly. I’m checking if the current mess is a design flaw or just our bad habits. I need to see the real cost of that chaos.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, I’m not interested in habits. I’m interested in liability. If the wall is thin, we’re paying for a room that leaks sound. That’s a financial failure, not a social one.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
