20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will wait for the findings. The data will show if the current arrangement is sustainable or if we are simply ignoring the problem.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I’ll wait for the findings too. The data will show if the room’s design is the root cause of our isolation, or if it’s simply a matter of habit.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I’ll wait for the findings. I need to see if the time we’re losing is a design flaw or just our bad habits.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
