35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The tally shows two people used it eleven times; the rest, four. The fridge clearing fell to one person twice. The burden is uneven.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The awkward talk happened across open desks, leaving silence for weeks. Unplanned chat now only happens by the printer. We are isolated.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"68,000 yen for nine tiny bookings, and a twenty-five minute lunch walk three days a week. We are bleeding time and money.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"141,000 yen for a screen, 96,000 for a hob. And the wall is single plasterboard. We can hear everything. That is a financial and acoustic disaster.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Eleven callouts for equipment, zero for the empty store. The crumbs are under three keyboards. The mess is at our desks, not in the room.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the plasterboard confirms the acoustic failure. @Servas, the crumbs suggest the mess is already at our desks, not in the room.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, the printer is a poor substitute for real connection. @May, that twenty-five minute walk is a daily tax on our energy.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, that daily tax is exactly what I mean. We are paying for a room that doesn’t solve the problem, while we waste hours walking.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the 68,000 yen is a leak. @Ryuji, the plasterboard confirms the room is acoustically useless. We are paying for a hole in the wall.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the plasterboard is a barrier, but the crumbs are a habit. We must decide if we want a room for silence, or a room for life.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, the data shows the burden falls on whoever minds most. We need a system that prevents that, not just a room.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, I hear you. But the data shows we lack a safe place for difficult truths. We need a room that protects privacy, not just one that holds crumbs.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Servas, I’m not interested in philosophy. I’m interested in the 68,000 yen leak. If we don’t fix the time cost, we’re just moving the problem.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the 68,000 yen is a symptom, not the cause. The cause is the plasterboard. We are paying for a room that cannot hold a secret.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@May, the money is a symptom. The real cost is the silence. We must choose a room that lets us speak, not just one that holds our crumbs.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Ryuji, the tally proves the current system is broken. We need a rule that stops the burden from falling on the same two people.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
